.el .ds Aq '
.TH loom-doctor 1  "loom-doctor " 
.SH NAME
loom\-doctor \- Health checks. RPC\-free local action
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBloom\-doctor\fR [\fB\-\-daemon\-only\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Health checks. RPC\-free local action
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-daemon\-only\fR
Run only the daemon\-scoped checks (socket reachable + daemon responsive); report everything else as skipped. For hosts where Chromium/AOT artifacts are absent by design (e.g. a container healthcheck against an RPC\-only daemon image)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
